    owl:members ( <http://purl.org/LiMo/0.1/;Dataset> <http://purl.org/LiMo/0.1/;DistributionConditions> <http://purl.org/LiMo/0.1/;LicenseModel> <http://purl.org/LiMo/0.1/;Rights> <http://purl.org/LiMo/0.1/;UseConditions> ) .

